This is the README of Client
Client program takes monitors the input directory for any new created/added filename.
It filteres the data from the file based on regex patterns given and created filetered data map.
it then hit Server POST API "callServer" anf give filename and filtered data map to it.
Client program then deletes the file from input directory.

Config file given in args argument contains following -
input directory path, this is the directory program monitors for any new file
regex patters

In the CLI command we pass config file as argument.
--config /Users/smritisharma/Workspace/ArcticWolfAssignment/client.conf

To run the program you will need following
1. Maven installed
2. JDK installed

Then run command "mvn clean install" to build the project.
Run the project, this will run the client to monitor the directory.